# === Claude Configuration ===
# This app calls Claude through the Claude Agent SDK, billed to your
# Claude subscription (Pro/Max) — no pay-per-token API key needed.
#
# Docker: run `claude setup-token` once on the host (requires Claude Code
# logged in with your subscription), then paste the sk-ant-oat01-... token:
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=

# Local `npm run dev` on a machine with Claude Code logged in:
# leave CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN empty — credentials are picked up automatically.

# Optional model override (default: claude-sonnet-5)
# Other options: claude-opus-4-8 (higher quality, faster limit burn),
# claude-haiku-4-5 (fastest, lighter feedback quality)
CLAUDE_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5
